# Never ship personal data, secrets or local build state into an image.
**/data
**/backups
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
scripts/import/out
docs/presentation

# Local build/dependency state (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Repo/editor noise
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
apps/desktop/release
apps/desktop/.stage
